WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.757
Unit two. Preventing Common Illnesses!

2
00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:08.424
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:11.880
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:16.319
Today we learn about Preventing Common Illnesses. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.171 --> 00:00:21.987
Communicable disease. Say it with me. Communicable disease!

6
00:00:25.471 --> 00:00:29.471
Transmission. Say it with me. Transmission!

7
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.617
Incubation period. Say it with me. Incubation period!

8
00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:44.785
Symptom. Say it with me. Symptom!

9
00:00:48.276 --> 00:00:52.326
Immunization. Say it with me. Immunization!

10
00:00:55.829 --> 00:00:59.679
Quarantine. Say it with me. Quarantine!

11
00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:07.623
Hygiene practice. Say it with me. Hygiene practice!

12
00:01:11.108 --> 00:01:15.025
Recovery. Say it with me. Recovery!

13
00:01:18.504 --> 00:01:35.281
A communicable disease spreads through transmission, sometimes before any symptom appears during the incubation period. Immunization and good hygiene practice help prevent illness. Staying away from others while sick (isolation) and after being exposed (quarantine) can stop transmission.

14
00:01:35.331 --> 00:01:36.578
I can do that too!

15
00:01:38.103 --> 00:01:43.474
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.524 --> 00:01:45.140
Incubation period!

17
00:01:46.121 --> 00:01:51.595
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:51.645 --> 00:01:53.254
Hygiene practice!

19
00:01:54.218 --> 00:02:01.847
Did you know? Immunizations teach your immune system to recognize a disease without you having to get sick first!

20
00:02:01.897 --> 00:02:03.950
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:04.646 --> 00:02:12.920
Think and answer. How does immunization help prevent the spread of disease?

22
00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:14.120
Great answer!

23
00:02:15.247 --> 00:02:20.215
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:22.990
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

